}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is rumored to be the most popular and cutest girl in the school, and is particularly known for the striking contrast between her innocent appearance and her voluptuous figure."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She is said to have a bright, cheerful personality and is kind to everyone—truly the perfect beauty… or so they say."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"However, she is actually somewhat introverted and has intentionally adjusted her personality and appearance so that people can easily tell her apart from her twin sister, Mana."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Due to certain circumstances, she decided to take the entrance exam for Koiwaga Academy, a co-ed school, instead of attending the all-girls school she was supposed to enter through the school’s automatic promotion system."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After discovering that Ryousuke, for some reason, could tell her and Manai apart, she began actively seeking him out as the only person she could truly open up to."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a slightly masochistic side; the rougher he is with her, the more she feels desired, and the happier she becomes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c163387"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園で一番人気で一番可愛いと噂の娘で特に清楚な見た目と豊満すぎる体のギャップが凄いと評判。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格も明るく朗らかで誰にでも優しい、まさに完璧美少女……と言われている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし、本来はやや内向的であり、双子の妹である御園愛と周囲が見分けやすいように意図して性格と外見を調整している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事情がきっかけでエスカレーター式の女子校から共学である小岩河学園を受験した。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"良介がなぜか自分と愛を見分けられることが発覚してからは唯一心を許せる人として積極的に絡んでいく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ややＭなところがあり、激しくされればされるほど求められていると喜んでしまう。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"28383","sourceWorkId":"40144","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「私たちをばっちり見分けてくれて、嬉しかったから、その、お礼ですっ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"学園で一番人気で一番可愛いと噂の娘で特に清楚な見た目と"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"豊満すぎる体のギャップが凄いと評判。"},{"spoiler":false,"